<%= if @copy do %>A copy of the report you sent to the Hex administrators at support@hex.pm. Reply to this email to add to it.

<% end %>Package report

Package: <%= @package %>
Package URL: <%= @package_url %>
Reason: <%= @reason %>
Reporter: <%= @reporter.name %> (@<%= @reporter.username %>), <%= @reporter.email %>
<%= if @admin_url do %>Triage: <%= @admin_url %>
<% end %>
<%= @summary %>

<%= @description %>
